  ['국민연금공단 노령연금 안내', 'https://www.nps.or.kr/pnsinfo/ntpsklg/getOHAF0056M0.do'],
  ['국민연금공단 급여 안내', 'https://www.nps.or.kr/pnsinfo/ntpsklg/getOHAF0048M0.do'],
];
---
<DebtReliefPage slug="national-pension-early-deferred-calculator" c={c} sources={sources} sourcesTitle="출처" checked="공식 안내 확인: 2026-11-23">
